# name: test_error_message[aliasing_loop_container.py]
  '''
  aliasing_loop_container.py:3:9: error: `items` could alias `items`, which this loop is iterating
  
    3 |         items.append(1)
      |         ^^^^^
  
    help: iterate a copy so mutating it inside the loop can't alias:
            copy(items)
  
  '''
