  '''
  starred_assignment.py:3:5: error: Can't use desugaring assignment on a list.
  
    3 |     first, *rest = values
      |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  
    help: Assign the right hand side elements one by one.
  
  starred_assignment.py:3:12: error: a starred assignment target is not supported
  
    3 |     first, *rest = values
      |            ^^^^^
  
    help: take the parts by slicing instead:
            first = values[0]
            rest = values[1:]
  
  '''
